You must return to the main dungeon through the same magic portal as
through which you originally entered the quest. It is still located on
the same spot where you landed when you started the quest. You should
have remembered the spot.

Next time you first enter your quest, move ONE space and (s)earch a few
times, to reveal the magic portal (^).

Also, the message "you feel unworthy" means that the game tried to
change the weapon you were wielding into Vorpal Blade, which failed,
since, although you WERE wielding a longsword,  you were not wielding
a non-artifact.

